// Copy to Local.xcconfig (not committed) to point Debug builds at another API origin: compose's
// API_PORT when .env changes it, the web's dev server (http://localhost:5173), from the simulator
// only, for the site's pages to save, or this Mac's name.local for a phone on the same network.

HMT_API_BASE_URL = http:$(SLASH)$(SLASH)localhost:8081
